          "short": "$4$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2n}{5}&=\\frac{2\\times10}{5}\\\\\\frac{2n}{5}&=\\frac{20}{5}\\\\\\frac{2n}{5}&=4\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 29
      }
